      "id": 1,
      "title": "Optional physical GPU telemetry",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**CPU mode intentionally provides no physical GPU measurements.** Hardware panels remain N/A; no GPU is simulated. NVIDIA mode collects nvidia-smi every 60 seconds. Model VRAM from Ollama and physical device VRAM measure different things."
      }
    },
    {
